# Privacy Policy – Annam

Last Updated: October 2026

Welcome to Annam. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains what information the Annam application ("Annam", "we", "the app") collects, how it is used, and the choices you have.

## Information We Collect

**Account information**
* Name, email address, and phone number.
* Sign-in details when you use Sign in with Apple or Google Sign-In (we receive your name and email as shared by those services; we never receive your Apple or Google password).

**Farm and livestock data you enter**
* Farms, barns, and livestock records.
* Animal data, including health records, vaccinations, treatments, births, weights, production, feed, and expenses.
* Tasks, reminders, and QR codes generated for animals.

**Photos, videos, and audio**
* Photos and videos you choose to attach (for example in veterinary consultations, support conversations, or animal records), taken with your camera or selected from your photo library.
* Audio recorded with a video when you use the camera to capture one.
These are accessed only with your permission and only when you use these features.

**Subscription and purchase information**
* Your subscription plan (Free, Basic, or Pro), billing period, status, start and expiry dates, and renewal status.
* Transaction identifiers needed to verify and manage your subscription.
* We do **not** collect or store your card number or bank details.

**Location data**
* Your device location is used only when you grant permission and only to show weather forecasts for your farm when the farm has no saved location.

**Device and technical information**
* A notification token used to deliver push notifications.
* Information used to verify that requests come from a genuine copy of the app (Firebase App Check).
* App version information used to keep the app up to date.

## How We Use Information

We use the collected information to:

* Create and manage your account and sign you in.
* Provide the app's features: managing farms, livestock, health records, production, tasks, and reminders.
* Activate, verify, renew, restore, and manage your subscription and enforce plan limits.
* Let farm owners share access with the farm members they invite.
* Send notifications and reminders you request or that relate to your farm.
* Provide veterinary consultation features and customer support.
* Keep the app secure, prevent fraud and abuse, and improve performance and reliability.

We do **not** sell your personal information, and we do **not** use it for advertising or to track you across other companies' apps or websites.

## Subscriptions and Payments

* **On iOS (iPhone and iPad):** subscriptions are purchased only through Apple In-App Purchase. Payment is processed by Apple and charged to your Apple Account. Subscriptions renew automatically unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel your subscription in your Apple Account settings (App Store subscriptions). Refunds for App Store purchases are handled by Apple.
* **On Android:** payments are processed by our payment provider, EdfaPay. Card details are entered in EdfaPay's secure payment form and are not stored by Annam.
* We receive from Apple or EdfaPay only the information needed to confirm and manage your subscription (such as the plan, transaction identifiers, dates, and status).

## Farm Members and Shared Data

If you invite team members to your farm, they can view and manage the farm data allowed by the permissions you give them. Members' access is linked to the farm owner's subscription.

## Data Storage and Security

* Your data is stored on your device so the app works offline, and it is synchronized to secure cloud services (Google Firebase) when an internet connection is available.
* Photos and videos you upload are stored in secure cloud storage (Firebase Storage).
* Data is transmitted over encrypted connections (HTTPS/TLS).
* Access to data is restricted by security rules so that each user can access only their own data and the farms they belong to.

We take reasonable measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.

## Third-Party Services

The app uses the following third-party services, which process information according to their own privacy policies:

* Firebase Authentication (sign-in)
* Cloud Firestore (database and synchronization)
* Firebase Storage (photos and videos)
* Firebase Cloud Messaging (push notifications)
* Firebase Cloud Functions (secure server-side processing, including subscription verification)
* Firebase App Check (app integrity)
* Sign in with Apple
* Google Sign-In
* Apple App Store / In-App Purchase (iOS subscriptions)
* EdfaPay (Android payments)
* Open-Meteo (weather forecasts; receives only the farm or device coordinates needed for the forecast)

## User-Generated Content

You are responsible for the information you create and manage in the app, including farm records, livestock information, photos, videos, and messages.

## Notifications

The app may send notifications related to:

* Livestock management and tasks
* Vaccinations and treatments
* Births and production records
* Reminders you set
* Support messages
* Veterinary consultations
* Subscription status (for example, upcoming expiry)
* Important announcements about the app

You can manage notification permissions at any time in your device settings.

## Data Retention

We keep your data for as long as your account is active. Subscription and payment records may be kept for the period required for accounting, tax, and legal purposes.

## Account and Data Deletion

You can delete your account at any time from **Settings > Delete Account** in the app. Deleting your account removes your account and its associated data, except records we are legally required to keep. Deleting your account does **not** cancel an App Store subscription; please cancel it in your Apple Account settings to stop future charges. You can also request deletion by contacting us.

## Children's Privacy

The app is intended for farm owners and workers and is not directed to children under the age required by applicable laws. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

